        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-3$ or $x=\\dfrac{3}{2}$.",
          "worked": "Read the intersections of the sketch with the horizontal line $y=3$.\n\nThe left branch meets this line at $x=-3$, and the right branch meets it at $x=\\frac{3}{2}$. Both values lie in their respective branch domains. The middle branch has $1\\le y<2$, so it gives no further intersection.\n\nTherefore, $x=-3$ or $x=\\dfrac{3}{2}$.",
